# filename <space> file id on the host
#
# Fill one line per file and save this as scripts/embeddings.ids.
# For a Google Drive link of the form
#     https://drive.google.com/file/d/1AbCdEfGhIjKlMnOpQrStUvWxYz/view?usp=sharing
# the id is the segment between /d/ and /view:
#     msmarco-1m__vanilla_docs.npy  1AbCdEfGhIjKlMnOpQrStUvWxYz
#
# Every file must be shared as "Anyone with the link -- Viewer", otherwise the
# fetch receives a sign-in page instead of the payload. Sharing the enclosing
# folder is not enough: the script addresses files by id, so each file needs the
# link permission itself. Setting it on the folder before uploading applies it
# to everything added afterwards.
